Subject: [PATCH] drm: asahi: split J615 shared Compute UMA ownership


diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/asahi/buffer.rs b/drivers/gpu/drm/asahi/buffer.rs
index 98e162f84e91..1b12de1d4865 100644
